 (CentOS Stream 10) via systemd units, opened firewalld ports 2379/2380, and verified cross-member read/write consistency. Demonstrated availability during a member outage (stopped node3, wrote/read via node1+node2 quorum) and confirmed node3 caught up fully on restart. Completed the mandatory sequential node-restart protocol on all three nodes, verifying changed boot IDs and full cluster/data recovery after each.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Installed etcd v3.7.1 binaries (etcd, etcdctl, etcdutl) to /usr/local/bin on node1, node2, node3 via GitHub release tarball\",\"Created etcd system user and /var/lib/etcd data dir on each node\",\"Wrote systemd unit /etc/systemd/system/etcd.service on each node with correct per-node name/peer-URL and shared initial-cluster string\",\"Opened firewalld ports 2379/tcp and 2380/tcp permanently on all three nodes\",\"Enabled and started etcd on all three nodes; confirmed 3/3 members healthy and started via member list/endpoint health\",\"Wrote 'foo' from node1, read from node2 and node3; wrote 'baz' from node2, read from node3 and node1 - confirmed cross-member replication\",\"Stopped etcd on node3 to simulate a member outage; wrote/read key 'during-outage' via node1+node2 quorum while node3 was down\",\"Restarted etcd on node3; verified it caught up to the same raft applied index as node1/node2 and could read the key written during its outage\",\"Captured baseline boot_id and etcd health on all three nodes\",\"Sequentially rebooted node1, then node2, then node3 (one at a time, quorum preserved), polling each until reachable again\",\"Verified changed boot_id on each node post-reboot, confirmed etcd service reactivated, and confirmed full 3/3 cluster health, membership, and all previously written keys (foo, baz, during-outage) after each restart\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Three-member etcd cluster formed on node1/node2/node3\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-adbfb5ddba604380\"],\"summary\":\"member list and endpoint health from node1 show all three members (node1/node2/node3) started and healthy\"},{\"requirement\":\"Key written through any member is readable from the others\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4835beb307cf4423\",\"cmd-8a8e6ab5f505413c\",\"cmd-3136b136cb0d48af\",\"cmd-96c54abe8a474089\",\"cmd-25674cf1a5e7447b\",\"cmd-6ab71b5c3a104ba5\"],\"summary\":\"'foo' written on node1, read back on node2 and node3; 'baz' written on node2, read back on node3 and node1\"},{\"requirement\":\"Cluster keeps serving reads/writes while one member is unavailable\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-015d936aad79422d\",\"cmd-837a7f90dd424720\"],\"summary\":\"node3 etcd stopped, then a write and read of 'during-outage' succeeded using only node1+node2 endpoints while node3 was down\"},{\"requirement\":\"Unavailable member catches up when it returns\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a2bb3b38be1e4a5d\",\"cmd-b1cb477124ee45bb\"],\"summary\":\"node3 etcd restarted; endpoint status shows matching raft applied index (16) across all three members and node3 successfully reads 'during-outage' written while it was down\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-b98490b95a974a6a\"],\"summary\":\"Captured node1 boot_id 8f258838... and etcd endpoint health=true before reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: acknowledgement returned before disconnect, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-024bc2366ee14b15\",\"cmd-47b548e9320d4515\",\"cmd-5014b9a86d3b4bf2\",\"cmd-e4eda58d005849e3\",\"cmd-063836d5660f4bf8\"],\"summary\":\"Backgrounded reboot command acknowledged before disconnect; node became unreachable then returned with new boot_id c282648b...; etcd reactivated (active) and cluster health/data (during-outage, foo) confirmed intact\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-f40811391bf94b3d\"],\"summary\":\"Captured node2 boot_id 21de1f79... and etcd endpoint health=true before reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: acknowledgement returned before disconnect, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-47b6582c22df4a43\",\"cmd-57e407dd39f34039\",\"cmd-62890144cf08400f\",\"cmd-8a06c9a5d2e44d6e\",\"cmd-6d891ea082e24a9b\"],\"summary\":\"Backgrounded reboot acknowledged before disconnect; node unreachable then returned with new boot_id 305efbdc...; etcd reactivated and cluster health/data (baz) confirmed intact\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart (second restart of node3, post-recovery test): healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-04af3acc0ad94bc0\"],\"summary\":\"Captured node3 boot_id 83a0a80f... and etcd endpoint health=true before reboot (after earlier stop/start recovery test)\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart: acknowledgement returned before disconnect, changed boot identity, recovered state and full cluster quorum/membership\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-62e1fdfd32ee4f49\",\"cmd-7e5a7a0ee9d94d64\",\"cmd-3b2835bf256d4e37\",\"cmd-c799599be16f4f5a\",\"cmd-bfa6a00888914bb4\"],\"summary\":\"Backgrounded reboot acknowledged before disconnect; node unreachable then returned with new boot_id 56713fab...; etcd reactivated, member list shows all 3 members started, endpoint health 3/3 true, and all keys (foo, baz, during-outage) readable\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Built a 3-member etcd v3.7.1 cluster across node1/node2/node3 (CentOS Stream 10) via systemd units, opened firewalld ports 2379/2380, and verified cross-member read/write consistency. Demonstrated availability during a member outage (stopped node3, wrote/read via node1+node2 quorum) and confirmed node3 caught up fully on restart. Completed the mandatory sequential node-restart protocol on all three nodes, verifying changed boot IDs and full cluster/data recovery after each.","actions_performed":["Installed etcd v3.7.1 binaries (etcd, etcdctl, etcdutl) to /usr/local/bin on node1, node2, node3 via GitHub release tarball","Created etcd system user and /var/lib/etcd data dir on each node","Wrote systemd unit /etc/systemd/system/etcd.service on each node with correct per-node name/peer-URL and shared initial-cluster string","Opened firewalld ports 2379/tcp and 2380/tcp permanently on all three nodes","Enabled and started etcd on all three nodes; confirmed 3/3 members healthy and started via member list/endpoint health","Wrote 'foo' from node1, read from node2 and node3; wrote 'baz' from node2, read from node3 and node1 - confirmed cross-member replication","Stopped etcd on node3 to simulate a member outage; wrote/read key 'during-outage' via node1+node2 quorum while node3 was down","Restarted etcd on node3; verified it caught up to the same raft applied index as node1/node2 and could read the key written during its outage","Captured baseline boot_id and etcd health on all three nodes","Sequentially rebooted node1, then node2, then node3 (one at a time, quorum preserved), polling each until reachable again","Verified changed boot_id on each node post-reboot, confirmed etcd service reactivated, and confirmed full 3/3 cluster health, membership, and all previously written keys (foo, baz, during-outage) after each restart"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Three-member etcd cluster formed on node1/node2/node3","command_ids":["cmd-adbfb5ddba604380"],"summary":"member list and endpoint health from node1 show all three members (node1/node2/node3) started and healthy"},{"requirement":"Key written through any member is readable from the others","command_ids":["cmd-4835beb307cf4423","cmd-8a8e6ab5f505413c","cmd-3136b136cb0d48af","cmd-96c54abe8a474089","cmd-25674cf1a5e7447b","cmd-6ab71b5c3a104ba5"],"summary":"'foo' written on node1, read back on node2 and node3; 'baz' written on node2, read back on node3 and node1"},{"requirement":"Cluster keeps serving reads/writes while one member is unavailable","command_ids":["cmd-015d936aad79422d","cmd-837a7f90dd424720"],"summary":"node3 etcd stopped, then a write and read of 'during-outage' succeeded using only node1+node2 endpoints while node3 was down"},{"requirement":"Unavailable member catches up when it returns","command_ids":["cmd-a2bb3b38be1e4a5d","cmd-b1cb477124ee45bb"],"summary":"node3 etcd restarted; endpoint status shows matching raft applied index (16) across all three members and node3 successfully reads 'during-outage' written while it was down"},{"requirement":"node1 restart: healthy baseline before restart","command_ids":["cmd-b98490b95a974a6a"],"summary":"Captured node1 boot_id 8f258838... and etcd endpoint health=true before reboot"},{"requirement":"node1 restart: acknowledgement returned before disconnect, changed boot identity, recovered state","command_ids":["cmd-024bc2366ee14b15","cmd-47b548e9320d4515","cmd-5014b9a86d3b4bf2","cmd-e4eda58d005849e3","cmd-063836d5660f4bf8"],"summary":"Backgrounded reboot command acknowledged before disconnect; node became unreachable then returned with new boot_id c282648b...; etcd reactivated (active) and cluster health/data (during-outage, foo) confirmed intact"},{"requirement":"node2 restart: healthy baseline before restart","command_ids":["cmd-f40811391bf94b3d"],"summary":"Captured node2 boot_id 21de1f79... and etcd endpoint health=true before reboot"},{"requirement":"node2 restart: acknowledgement returned before disconnect, changed boot identity, recovered state","command_ids":["cmd-47b6582c22df4a43","cmd-57e407dd39f34039","cmd-62890144cf08400f","cmd-8a06c9a5d2e44d6e","cmd-6d891ea082e24a9b"],"summary":"Backgrounded reboot acknowledged before disconnect; node unreachable then returned with new boot_id 305efbdc...; etcd reactivated and cluster health/data (baz) confirmed intact"},{"requirement":"node3 restart (second restart of node3, post-recovery test): healthy baseline before restart","command_ids":["cmd-04af3acc0ad94bc0"],"summary":"Captured node3 boot_id 83a0a80f... and etcd endpoint health=true before reboot (after earlier stop/start recovery test)"},{"requirement":"node3 restart: acknowledgement returned before disconnect, changed boot identity, recovered state and full cluster quorum/membership","command_ids":["cmd-62e1fdfd32ee4f49","cmd-7e5a7a0ee9d94d64","cmd-3b2835bf256d4e37","cmd-c799599be16f4f5a","cmd-bfa6a00888914bb4"],"summary":"Backgrounded reboot acknowledged before disconnect; node unreachable then returned with new boot_id 56713fab...; etcd reactivated, member list shows all 3 members started, endpoint health 3/3 true, and all keys (foo, baz, during-outage) readable"}]},"ttft_ms":2649,"type":"result","duration_ms":334485,"uuid":"a4cdff19-360c-43b0-98cb-4b005601c23a","ttft_stream_ms":2280,"time_to_request_ms":70,"first_content_frame_ms":2536,"queued_turn_count":0}
